# Platinum story 19-fantina-relic-badge: standalone start (--lab, or no end save from 18).
# Standard header + lab party + the cumulative state after 18 (pt_story_early.md table),
# then the milestone's start. Names resolve through pc/tests/pc_lab.py; flag/var lines cite the script that sets them.
name GQ
gender GENDER_MALE
trainer-id 31415
money 20000
var VAR_PLAYER_STARTER SPECIES_TURTWIG  # rival teams use the *_TURTWIG variants (scripts_route_203.s:71-74, scripts_jubilife_city.s:907-914; src/system_vars.c:67-72)
# Standard lab party (pt_story_early.md): Surf in slot 0 and slots 1-3 cleared, so an
# empty Surf falls back to Struggle instead of stalling A-only battles. Staraptor
# carries the field moves (Rock Smash, Cut) and fights only in true doubles.
party SPECIES_EMPOLEON 60 ITEM_NONE
party-move 0 0 MOVE_SURF
party-move 0 1 MOVE_NONE
party-move 0 2 MOVE_NONE
party-move 0 3 MOVE_NONE
party SPECIES_STARAPTOR 50 ITEM_NONE
party-move 1 0 MOVE_AERIAL_ACE
party-move 1 1 MOVE_ROCK_SMASH
party-move 1 2 MOVE_CUT
